rading my Xcode (thank god, still using 9.3).\r\n\r\nFor me, the reason is because the build terminal output showed that there were 3 packages that I had linked manually that I needed to unlink (via: `react-native unlink PACKAGE-NAME`) so that the autolinking could work.\r\n\r\nAfter running that command for the 3 packages I had linked manually, I ran an `npm install` and `react-native run-ios` and everything worked.\r\n\r\n(Same comment I put into #25492 )","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/514418621/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ben-pritchard","id":9130046,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMzAwNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9130046?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ben-pritchard","html_url":"https://github.com/ben-pritchard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ben-pritchard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ben-pritchard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ben-pritchard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ben-pritchard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ben-pritchard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ben-pritchard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ben-pritchard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ben-pritchard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ben-pritchard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2506026448,"node_id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50MjUwNjAyNjQ0OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/events/2506026448","actor":{"login":"AnderLuiz","id":1660564,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NjA1NjQ=","avatar_url":"htt